# Review Scope

Primary retrospective review question:

> Did the implemented Stage I DC approximation and AC projection comparison
> faithfully execute the approved GridFM, DC, heuristic, and AC-projection
> methodology, and are there material scientific, physical, experimental,
> implementation, or literature-alignment issues that should be addressed before
> interpreting the results?

The review is non-destructive. The reviewer may read code, documentation,
results, run existing validation, and produce findings. The reviewer may not
modify source code, tests, result files, historical plans, or reviewer criteria.
